    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d615">

                <pb facs="0992" n="978" sameAs="frus:frus1950v06/pg978"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856D.10/2–350: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in Indonesia
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-02-07T17:00:00-05:00">February 7, 1950—5
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>135. For Jessup from Rusk. Dept shares your views re necessity US financial aid
                    at this stage to help RUSI achieve stability
                    and withstand Communism. We have recd several indications that ExImBank
                    officials are viewing Indo application in same light.</p>
                <p>As you have seen from recent tels to Jakarta, Indos have not yet stated dol
                    credit requirements, but you may be assured Dept is prepared to emphasize
                    ExImBank at appropriate time in immed future the considerations which change
                    problem from banking investment to polit necessity not only for our objectives
                    in Indo, but also for our objectives throughout Southeast Asia.</p>
                <p>We believe Djuanda has been more than satisfied with treatment he has recd here,
                    although at times, he seems to have been somewhat perplexed, a condition
                    probably due in very large measure to fact current trip is his first visit to
                    US. [Rusk.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
